Note on the kernel sources and build output

The Linux kernel source used by this pipeline is distributed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 (GPL-2.0).  The kernel patches in this
repository are derivative works of that source and are therefore also licensed
under GPL-2.0.

Any kernel image (`Image`) or boot image produced by this pipeline is a
derivative of the Linux kernel and is consequently distributed under GPL-2.0.
Corresponding source is available from:

    https://github.com/PerezChilli/android_kernel_xiaomi_nabu

plus the patch files in this repository.  Build artifacts are reproducible from
the workflow inputs documented in README.md.

KernelSU components embedded in the build come from:
    https://github.com/Baka-SU/BakaSU

Boot image repacking is based on the Android boot image format
(header v3); see tools/repack_boot.js.
